[{"id":2719,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>Interaktion 2.12</h3>\n  <h4>Ein <a data-tooltip=\"family portrait\">Familienbild°</a>:</h4>\n  <form class=\"NoDrag\" id=\"2_12\">\n  <p>Vokabel-Tipps zum Thema »<a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"family\">Familie</a>«:</p>\n  <div class=\"clearfix\">\n    <div class=\"floatleft width-200\">\n      <p>der Großvater, ¨-</p>\n      <p>die Großmutter, ¨-</p>\n      <p>die <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"mother\">Mutter</a>, ¨- / <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"Mom / Mommy\">Mama</a></p>\n      <p>der <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"father\">Vater</a>, ¨- / <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"Dad / Daddy\">Papa</a></p>\n      <p>der Onkel, -</p>\n      <p>die Tante, -n</p>\n      <p>das Kind, -er:</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"floatleft width-200\">\n      <p>der <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"son\">Sohn</a>, ¨-e</p>\n      <p>die <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"daughter\">Tochter</a>, ¨-</p>\n      <p>der <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"brother\">Bruder</a>, ¨-</p>\n      <p>das Enkelkind, -er</p>\n      <p>die <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"sister\">Schwester</a>, -n</p>\n      <p>der Cousin/Vetter, -n</p>\n      <p>die Cousine/Kusine, -n</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"floatleft\">\n      <p><img class=\"width-250\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/I2.12.png\"/></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <p>Wie viele von diesen Vokabeln <a data-tooltip=\"apply\">passen°</a> zu <em>Ihrer</em> Familie? Schreiben Sie eine Liste!</p>\n  <br/>\n  \n    <textarea class=\"textarea-default\" name=\"response\"></textarea>\n    <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"rsTmb\">\n    <h5>2.12</h5>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":"2022","label":"2.12","dateCreated":"2023-01-12T14:44:04.42","dateModified":"2023-01-12T14:44:04.46","slideTypeId":1,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":654,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>Interaktion 2.13</h3>\n  <h4>Ein etwas anderes Familienbild</h4>\n  <form id=\"2_13\">\n      \n  <p>Ein paar Extra-Vokabeln zum Thema »Familie«:</p>\n  <p><img class=\"floatright width-250\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/I2.13_A.jpg\"/></p>\n  <p><a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"to know, be acquianted with\">Kennen</a> Sie <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"these\">diese</a> Leute?</p>\n  <div class=\"clearfix\">\n    <div class=\"floatleft\" style=\"margin-right:4px;width:200px\">\n      <p><a data-tooltip=\"stepmother\">Stiefmutter°</a></p>\n      <p>Stiefvater</p>\n      <p>Stiefbruder</p>\n      <p>Stiefschwester</p>\n      <p>der Partner, -</p>\n      <p>die Partnerin, -nen</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"floatleft\" style=\"margin-right:4px;;width:200px\">\n      <p>Ex-Mann</p>\n      <p>Ex-Frau</p>\n      <p>Adoptivkind</p>\n      <p><a data-tooltip=\"divorced\">geschieden°</a></p>\n      <p><a data-tooltip=\"married\">verheiratet°</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <br/>\n  <br/>\n  <p><img src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/I2.13_B.png\"/></p>\n  <p class=\"formBorder\"></p>\n  <p>Also: Wer ist wer in der TV-Show »modern family«? (Die Show ist auch in Deutschland <a data-tooltip=\"well-known\">bekannt°</a>!) <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"which\">Welche</a> Person ist mit welcher anderen Person <a data-tooltip=\"related\">verwandt°</a>?</p>\n  <ol class=\"indent-25 lineheight-large\">\n    <li><p>Jay ist <input class=\"width-300\" name=\"1a\" type=\"text\"/>von Gloria und <input class=\"width-300\" name=\"1b\" type=\"text\"/>von Manuel.</p></li>\n    <li><p>Mitchell ist <input class=\"width-300\" name=\"2a\" type=\"text\"/>von Cameron, und <input class=\"width-300\" name=\"2b\" type=\"text\"/>von Haley.</p></li>\n    <li><p>Claire ist <input class=\"width-300\" name=\"3a\" type=\"text\"/>von Phil, und<input class=\"width-300\" name=\"3b\" type=\"text\"/>von Haley, Alex und Luke.</p></li>\n    <li><p>Manuel ist <input class=\"width-500\" name=\"4\" type=\"text\"/>.</p></li>\n    <li><p>Lily ist <input class=\"width-500\" name=\"5\" type=\"text\"/>.</p></li>\n    <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"6\" type=\"text\"/>.</p></li>\n  </ol>\n  <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n</form>\n<div class=\"box\">\n<p>Ein kleiner Tipp zum englischen Verb <em>to know:</em></p> <p>Man <strong>kennt</strong> Leute &#8212; aber man <strong>weiß</strong> Information (von dem Verb <strong>wissen</strong> [Kapitel 6] &rarr; Ich weiß. <em>I know.</em> / Ich weiß nicht. <em>I don't know.</em>) </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rsTmb\">\n  <h5>2.13</h5>\n</div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":null,"label":"2.13","dateCreated":"2022-05-23T19:13:45.287","dateModified":"2022-05-23T19:13:45.337","slideTypeId":1,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":2712,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>Interaktion 2.14</h3>\n  <h4>Eine vernetzte Familie</h4>\n  <form id=\"2_14\">\n    <p><img class=\"width-150 floatright\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/I2.14_a.png\" style=\"padding:10px;\"/></p>\n    <p>Tobias (»Tobi«) arbeitet bei einer <a data-tooltip=\"development\">Entwicklungs°</a>-Organisation in Äthiopien.</p>\n    <p>Die Schwester von Tobi, Eva, wohnt in Frankfurt mit ihrem Mann Viktor. Sie sind die <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"parents\">Eltern</a> von drei <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"children\">Kindern</a>.</p>\n\n    <img class=\"width-300 floatleft\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/I2.14_b.png\" style=\"padding:10px\">\n    <p>Andreas (»Andy«) ist der Bruder von Tobi. Hier sehen Sie Andy und Margit. Sie <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"to live\">leben</a> im Süden von Deutschland. Andi ist der Bruder von Tobi. Margit und Andreas haben drei <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"young\">junge</a> Kinder —\n    zwei Töchter und einen Sohn. Die zwei <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"girls\">Mädchen</a> heißen Samara und Hannah, und der <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"boy\">Junge</a> heißt Joel.</p>\n    \n<p>Die Großmutter — die Mutter von Tobi, Eva und Andi — lebt in der <a data-tooltip=\"same\">selben°</a> Kleinstadt wie Andi und Margit, also sehen die drei Enkelkinder <a data-tooltip=\"their\">ihre°</a> Großmutter oft. Aber Eva lebt mit ihrem Mann und ihren Kindern in Frankfurt, und Tobi lebt in Afrika, also <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"really\">wirklich</a> <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"far\">weit</a> von Stuttgart. Die Familie <a data-tooltip=\"wants\">will°</a> aber in\n  einer <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"close, tight\">engen</a> <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"relationship\">Beziehung</a> bleiben. <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"each / every\">Jedes</a> Wochenende zoomen? Viele E-Mails schreiben? Was kann man machen?</p>\n  <p><span data-tooltip=\"listen carefully\">Hören Sie gut zu°</span>!</p>\n  <br/>\n  <a class=\"audio-player\" data-audio=\"/audio/kapitel2/I.2.14.Andy.mp3\"></a>\n  \n  <img class=\"width-250 floatright\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/I2.14_c.png\"/>\n  <br/>\n  <p>Wie bleibt die Familie vernetzt? </p>\n  <p><input name=\"schreibt_emails\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Die Familie schreibt E-Mails.</p>\n  <p><input name=\"telefoniert\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Die Familie telefoniert.</p>\n  <p><input name=\"chattet\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Die Familie chattet.</p>\n  <p><input name=\"facebook_instagram\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Die Familie benutzt Facebook und Instagram.</p>\n  <p><input name=\"zoom\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Die Familie benutzt Zoom.</p>\n  <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n</form>\n<div class=\"rsTmb\">\n  <h5>2.14</h5>\n</div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":"2022","label":"2.14","dateCreated":"2024-10-08T14:03:11.193","dateModified":"2024-10-08T14:03:11.223","slideTypeId":1,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":656,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>Interaktion 2.15</h3>\n  <h4>Ich kenne eine Familie ...</h4>\n  <form id=\"2_15\">\n      \n   <div class=\"clearfix\">\n    <img class=\"floatleft width-220 height-120\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/I2.15_A.jpg\"/>\n    <img class=\"floatleft width-120 indent-20\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/I2.15_B.jpg\"/>\n    <img class=\"floatleft width-250 indent-20 height-120\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/I2.15_C.jpg\"/>\n  </div>\n  \n    <p>Benutzen Sie die »Familien«-Vokabeln in diesen Interaktionen und schreiben Sie ein bisschen über eine Familie &#8212;  vielleicht eine Familie in einem Film oder im Fernsehen, vielleicht Ihre <a data-tooltip=\"own\">eigene°</a> Familie, oder vielleicht eine Familie, <a data-tooltip=\"that\">die°</a> Sie gut kennen.</p>\n    \n    <p>Wie heißen sie <a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"all\">alle</a>? Wo wohnen sie? Was machen sie gern? </p>\n    \n   \n    <br/>\n    <textarea class=\"textarea-default\" name=\"response\"></textarea>\n    <br/>\n    \n  <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n </div>\n \n</form>\n<div class=\"rsTmb\">\n  <h5>2.15</h5>\n</div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":null,"label":"2.15","dateCreated":"2018-08-14T22:05:02.137","dateModified":"2018-08-09T20:03:40","slideTypeId":1,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":657,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>Interaktion 2.16</h3>\n  <h4>Und <a data-tooltip=\"one more\">noch eine°</a> vernetzte Familie ...</h4>\n  <br/>\n  <img class=\"width-75pc\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/I2.16.png\"/>\n  <p class=\"phrasebox vocab\">\n    <span><a data-tooltip=\"to be correct\">stimmen°</a> → <a data-tooltip=\"That's right\">Das stimmt°</a>.</span>\n  <span>»<a class=\"firstOccurrence\" data-tooltip=\"everything / all\">Alles</a> <a data-tooltip=\"[Wishing you] everything that's good\">Gute°</a>.«</span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"formBorder\"></p>\n<form id=\"2_16\">\n  <ol class=\"indent-25\">\n    <li><p>Kurt ist <input class=\"width-300\" name=\"1\" type=\"text\"/>von Reiner.</p></li>\n    <li><p>Und Reiner ist <input class=\"width-300\" name=\"2\" type=\"text\"/>von Kurt.</p></li>\n    <li><p>Wie heißt »vor« in »vor 13 Minuten«? (auf Englisch) <input class=\"width-400\" name=\"3\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n  </ol>\n  <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n</form>\n<div class=\"rsTmb\">\n  <h5>2.16</h5>\n</div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":null,"label":"2.16","dateCreated":"2018-08-14T22:05:02.137","dateModified":"2016-04-04T20:14:51","slideTypeId":1,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":658,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>C. Welch- / Dies-</h3>\n  <p><em>Which</em> email? <em>That</em> email? No, <em>this</em> email!</p>\n  <p>German has words that emphasize and specify nouns, similar to <em>this</em> and <em>which</em>.</p>\n  <br/>\n  <h3>C.1</h3>\n  <div class=\"clearfix\">\n    <div class=\"floatleft\" style=\"margin-right:4px; width:220px;\">\n      <p><img src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/SC_a.png\"/><br/>\n        <span style=\"font-size:0.9em;\">»Welches Foto meinst du?« »DIESES Foto natürlich!«</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"floatleft\" style=\"margin-right:4px; width:230px;\">\n      <p><img src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/SC_b.png\"/><br/>\n        <span style=\"font-size:0.9em;\">»Dieser Schuh <a data-tooltip=\"fits\">passt°</a> nicht.« »Welcher Schuh?« »DIESER Schuh!«</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"floatleft\" style=\"margin-right:4px; width:200px;\">\n      <p><img src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/SC_c.png\"/>\n        <span style=\"font-size:0.9em;\">»Ach, diese <a data-tooltip=\"lecture\">Vorlesung°</a>…«</span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"formBorder\"></p>\n \n  <p>You haven’t learned the nouns in the pictures above, but can you guess their grammatical gender from the words preceding them? Click on the gender you\n  think is correct: </p>\n  <form id=\"C.1\">\n    <p>\n      <span class=\"clearfix\">\n        <span class=\"floatleft\" style=\"width:100px;\"><a data-tooltip=\"photo\">Foto°:</a></span>\n        <span class=\"floatleft radiobox\">\n          <span><input name=\"1\" type=\"radio\" value=\"der\"/>der</span>\n          <span><input name=\"1\" type=\"radio\" value=\"die\"/>die</span>\n          <span><input name=\"1\" type=\"radio\" value=\"das\"/>das</span>\n        </span>\n      </span>\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <span class=\"clearfix\">\n        <span class=\"floatleft\" style=\"width:100px;\"><a data-tooltip=\"shoe\">Schuh°:</a></span>\n        <span class=\"floatleft radiobox\">\n          <span><input name=\"2\" type=\"radio\" value=\"der\"/>der</span>\n          <span><input name=\"2\" type=\"radio\" value=\"die\"/>die</span>\n          <span><input name=\"2\" type=\"radio\" value=\"das\"/>das</span>\n        </span>\n      </span>\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <span class=\"clearfix\">\n        <span class=\"floatleft\" style=\"width:100px;\"><a data-tooltip=\"lecture\">Vorlesung°:</a></span>\n        <span class=\"floatleft radiobox\">\n          <span><input name=\"3\" type=\"radio\" value=\"der\"/>der</span>\n          <span><input name=\"3\" type=\"radio\" value=\"die\"/>die</span>\n          <span><input name=\"3\" type=\"radio\" value=\"das\"/>das</span>\n        </span>\n      </span>\n    </p>\n    <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n  </form>\n  <p>This is relatively simple if you think of the endings for <strong>welch-</strong> and <strong>dies-</strong> in the pictures above as mirroring the definite articles:</p>\n  <p>Welch<strong class=\"grammar\">es</strong> Foto? Dies<strong class=\"grammar\">es</strong> Foto! → <strong class=\"grammar\">das</strong> Foto.</p>\n  <p>Welch<strong class=\"grammar\">er</strong> Schuh? Dies<strong class=\"grammar\">er</strong> Schuh! → <strong class=\"grammar\">der</strong> Schuh</p>\n  <p>Welch<strong class=\"grammar\">e</strong> Vorlesung? Dies<strong class=\"grammar\">e</strong> Vorlesung → <strong class=\"grammar\">die</strong> Vorlesung</p>\n  <br/>\n  <p>Compare this pattern with the indefinite articles you would apply to these nouns, as you learned in Chapter 1:</p>\n  <div class=\"indent-25\">\n    <p><strong>ein</strong> Foto</p>\n    <p><strong>ein</strong> Schuh</p>\n    <p><strong>eine</strong> Vorlesung</p>\n  </div>\n  <p>Notice the difference: With masculine and neuter nouns in the nominative case, <strong>ein</strong> doesn’t take an ending, which means that it does not distinguish between\n  masculine and neuter nouns. But <strong>welcher/welches</strong> and <strong>dieser/dieses</strong> clearly distinguish between the genders, just like the definite articles.</p>\n  <p>To emphasize this similarity, words such as <strong>welch-</strong> and <strong>dies-</strong> that follow the pattern of <strong>der/die/das</strong> are called <strong>der-</strong>words.</p>\n  <p>For plural nouns, <strong>der-</strong>words take an <strong class=\"grammar\">–e</strong> in the nominative case, mirroring the plural article die: welch<strong class=\"grammar\">e</strong> E-Mails? / dies<strong class=\"grammar\">e</strong> E-Mails.</p>\n  <p>It may help you to see these in chart-form:</p>\n  <table class='border' cellpadding=\"4\" style=\"padding:4px;\" width=\"90%\">\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"4\"><strong>Singular</strong></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><strong>Plural</strong></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><em>Masculine</em></td>\n    <td><em>Feminine</em></td>\n    <td><em>Neuter</em></td>\n    <td>\u00A0</td>\n    <td>\u00A0</td>\n    <td>\u00A0</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>dies<strong class=\"grammar\">er</strong></td>\n    <td>dies<strong class=\"grammar\">e</strong></td>\n    <td>dies<strong class=\"grammar\">es</strong></td>\n    <td><em>this</em></td>\n    <td>dies<strong class=\"grammar\">e</strong></td>\n    <td><em>these</em></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>welch<strong class=\"grammar\">er</strong></td>\n    <td>welch<strong class=\"grammar\">e</strong></td>\n    <td>welch<strong class=\"grammar\">es</strong></td>\n    <td><em>which</em></td>\n    <td>welch<strong class=\"grammar\">e</strong></td>\n    <td><em>which</em></td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n<p>\u00A0</p>\n\n<div class=\"rsTmb\">\n  <h5>C.1</h5>\n</div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":null,"label":"C.1","dateCreated":"2024-10-14T16:38:57.703","dateModified":"2024-10-14T16:38:57.773","slideTypeId":2,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":659,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <!-- -------------------------- SLIDE BREAK -------------------------------- -->\n  <h3>Übung 2.4</h3>\n  <p class=\"formBorder\"></p>\n  <p>Using <strong>dies-</strong> or <strong>welch-</strong> with the appropriate ending, create sentences and questions with your choice of the elements provided:</p>\n  <p>z.B.: Kind: spielen / jung → <strong>Welches</strong> Kind spielt gern? (oder) <strong>Dieses</strong> Kind ist sehr jung.</p>\n  <form id=\"u2_4\">\n    <ol class=\"indent-25\">\n      <li>\n        <p>Aufgabe: lang / kurz / einfach / machen</p>\n        <p><input class=\"width-550\" name=\"aufgabe\" type=\"text\"/></p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <p>Freunde: wohnen / arbeiten / lesen / gern / auf dem Campus</p>\n        <p><input class=\"width-550\" name=\"freunde\" type=\"text\"/></p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <p>Uni: die besten Studenten / klein / groß / stressig</p>\n        <p><input class=\"width-550\" name=\"uni\" type=\"text\"/></p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <p>Buch: interessant / gut / wichtig</p>\n        <p><input class=\"width-550\" name=\"buch\" type=\"text\"/></p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <p>Computer: neu / gefällt mir / klein / gut</p>\n        <p><input class=\"width-550\" name=\"computer\" type=\"text\"/></p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <p>Eltern: wohnen / arbeiten / gern / lesen / zu Hause</p>\n        <p><input class=\"width-550\" name=\"eltern\" type=\"text\"/></p>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n    <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"rsTmb\">\n    <h5>Ü2.4</h5>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":null,"label":"Ü2.4","dateCreated":"2024-10-14T16:34:55.097","dateModified":"2024-10-14T16:34:55.12","slideTypeId":2,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":660,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>Übung 2.5</h3>\n  <p class=\"formBorder\"></p>\n  <form id=\"u2_5\">\n    <p>How would you express these sentences in German?</p>\n    <ol class=\"indent-25 inline-block-span\">\n      <li>\n        <p><span class=\"width-250\"><em>Which group is it?</em></span>\n          <span><input class=\"width-300\" name=\"1\" type=\"text\"/></span>\n        </p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <p><span class=\"width-250\"><em>Which woman do you know?</em></span>\n          <span><input class=\"width-300\" name=\"2\" type=\"text\"/></span>\n        </p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <p><span class=\"width-250\"><em>Which network do you use?</em></span>\n          <span><input class=\"width-300\" name=\"3\" type=\"text\"/></span>\n        </p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <p><span class=\"width-250\"><em>This computer is good!</em></span>\n          <span><input class=\"width-300\" name=\"4\" type=\"text\"/></span>\n        </p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <p><span class=\"width-250\"><em>Which question is interesting?</em></span>\n          <span><input class=\"width-300\" name=\"5\" type=\"text\"/></span>\n        </p>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <p><span class=\"width-250\"><em>This question, of course!</em></span>\n          <span><input class=\"width-300\" name=\"6\" type=\"text\"/></span>\n        </p>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n    <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"rsTmb\">\n    <h5>Ü2.5</h5>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":null,"label":"Ü2.5","dateCreated":"2018-08-14T22:05:02.137","dateModified":"2018-08-14T22:05:02.137","slideTypeId":2,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":661,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>C.2</h3>\n  <p>If <em>this child</em> translates to <strong>dieses Kind,</strong> and <em>these people</em> to <strong>diese Leute,</strong> how do you say <em><u>that</u> child</em> and <em><u>those</u> people?</em></p>\n  <p>In German this is not as straightforward as <em>this</em> and <em>which.</em> German does in fact have a word for <em>that</em> <strong>(jen-),</strong> and it is a <strong>der-</strong>word, like <strong>dies-</strong> and <strong>welch-.</strong> But unlike these two words, <strong>jen-</strong> is used almost exclusively in literary and academic contexts, and only\n  rarely in normal conversation.</p>\n  <p>To convey the idea of <em>that</em> <span class=\"line-blank\" style=\"width:80px;\"></span> in everyday language, German uses the definite article, plus intonational emphasis (shown here by underlining), with the\n  optional addition of <strong>da</strong> <em>(there)</em> if a location is implied:</p>\n  <div class=\"indent-25\">\n    <p>Dieses Kind oder <u>das</u> Kind (da)? (with stress on <strong>das</strong>)</p>\n    <p><em>This child or that child (there)? </em></p>\n    <p>Ich kenne diese Leute, aber nicht <u>die</u> Leute. (with stress on <strong>die</strong>)</p>\n    <p><em>I know these people, but not those people. </em></p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"rsTmb\">\n    <h5>C.2</h5>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":null,"label":"C.2","dateCreated":"2018-08-14T22:05:02.137","dateModified":"2018-08-14T22:05:02.137","slideTypeId":2,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":662,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>Übung 2.6</h3>\n  <p class=\"formBorder\"></p>\n  <p><img class=\"floatright\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/S2.6.png\"/>Contrast the elements in the illustrations by referring to <em>this</em> one and then <em>that</em> one, using the vocabulary items in the two boxes. To develop a feel for using this in practice, say the sentences out loud, emphasizing the word for  <em>that</em>.</p>\n  <p>z.B.: »Dieser Mann ist sehr klein, aber <u>der</u> Mann da ist sehr groß.« (oder)</p>\n  <p class=\"indent-40\">»Dieser Mann ist klein, aber <u>der</u> Mann ist nicht so klein.«</p>\n  <p class=\"phrasebox\">\n    <span>sehr</span>\n    <span>ein bisschen</span>\n    <span>besonders</span>\n    <span>eigentlich</span>\n    <span>nicht (so)</span>\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"vocabbox\">gut klein lang positiv schlecht schön normal negativ wichtig jung alt</p>\n  <form id=\"u2_6\">\n    <p class=\"indent-20\"><img class=\"width-300\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/S2.6a.png\"/></p>\n    <p>1. <input class=\"width-500\" name=\"1\" type=\"text\"/></p>\n    \n<br></br>    \n    \n    <p class=\"indent-20\"><img class=\"width-300\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/S2.6b.png\"/></p>\n    <p>2. <input class=\"width-500\" name=\"2\" type=\"text\"/></p>\n    \n<br></br>    \n    \n    <p class=\"indent-20\"><img class=\"height-200\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/S2.6c.png\"/></p>\n    <p>3. <input class=\"width-500\" name=\"3\" type=\"text\"/></p>\n    \n<br></br>    \n    \n    <p class=\"indent-20\"><img class=\"width-350\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/S2.6.NYC.Princeton.Map.png\"/></p>\n    <p>4. <input class=\"width-500\" name=\"4\" type=\"text\"/></p>\n    <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"rsTmb\">\n    <h5>Ü2.6</h5>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":null,"label":"Ü2.6","dateCreated":"2026-08-07T17:16:00.373","dateModified":"2026-08-07T17:16:00.457","slideTypeId":2,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":663,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>D. Jed- / All-</h3>\n  <p>Which email? <em>Every</em> email! <em>All</em> the emails!</p>\n  <p>The German words for <em>each/every</em> <strong>(jed-)</strong> and <em>all</em> <strong>(all-)</strong> are <strong>der-</strong>words that follow the pattern of the definite articles, just like <strong>welch-</strong> and <strong>dies-.</strong> They also\n  follow English usage, in that <strong>jed-</strong> only modifies singular nouns, while <strong>alle</strong> always modifies plural nouns.</p>\n  <div class=\"indent-25\">\n    <p><strong>Jede</strong> Aufgabe ist so lang! <em>Each/Every assignment is so long!</em></p>\n    <p><strong>Alle</strong> Aufgaben sind so lang! <em>All (the) assignments are so long!</em></p>\n  </div>\n  <p>Caution: Even though a phrase such as <em>every assignment</em> implies more than one assignment, the word <em>assignment</em> itself is singular. If you want to refer to\n  <em>assignments</em> &#8212; in the plural &#8212; you must use <strong>alle</strong> rather than <strong>jed-.</strong></p>\n  <p>Notice how the endings used with <strong>jed-</strong> indicate the gender of the singular nouns it modifies, and how the <strong class=\"grammar\">-e</strong> in <strong>alle</strong> mirrors the plural article <strong>die</strong>:</p>\n  <table class=\"indent-25\">\n    <tr>\n      <td><p>jed<strong class=\"grammar\">es</strong> Kind<br/>\n          jed<strong class=\"grammar\">er</strong> Computer<br/>\n      jed<strong class=\"grammar\">e</strong> Antwort</p></td>\n      <td><p><em>each/every child</em><br/>\n          <em>each/every computer</em><br/>\n      <em>each/every answer</em></p></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td><p>all<strong class=\"grammar\">e</strong> Kinder<br/>\n          all<strong class=\"grammar\">e</strong> Computer<br/>\n      all<strong class=\"grammar\">e</strong> Antworten</p></td>\n      <td><p><em>all (the) children</em><br/>\n          <em>all (the) computers</em><br/>\n      <em>all (the) answers</em></p></td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <p class=\"box width-250\" style=\"padding:10px;\"><strong>Remember:</strong><br/>\n    <strong>alle</strong> (plural) <em>all</em><br/>\n    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Alle sind hier!<br/>\n    <strong>alles</strong> (singular) <em>everything</em><br/>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Alles ist hier!</p>\n  <div class=\"rsTmb\">\n    <h5>D</h5>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":null,"label":"D","dateCreated":"2018-08-14T22:05:02.137","dateModified":"2016-04-04T20:19:49","slideTypeId":2,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":1331,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>Übung 2.7</h3>\n  <p class=\"formBorder\"></p>\n  <strong><h4>Die »perfekte« Uni!</h4></strong></p>\n  <p><img class=\"floatright width-350 indent-10\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/S2.7.jpg\"/>\n  <p>Think up some marketing statements about a “perfect” university: First, notice the gender of each noun in the column on the left. Then use <strong>jed-</strong> with these and combine them with the modifiers on the right to extol the perfection of <em>every</em> professor, <em>every</em> student, <em>every</em> dorm room …</p>\n  <div class=\"clearfix\">\n    <div class=\"floatleft\" style=\"margin-right:4px;width:250px\">\n      <p>der Kurs, -e<br/>\n        die Professorin, -nen<br/>\n        der Professor, -en<br/>\n        das <a data-tooltip=\"room\">Zimmer°</a>, -<br/>\n        das <a data-tooltip=\"dormitory\">Wohnheim°</a>, -e<br/>\n        die Prüfung, -en<br/>\n        die Aufgabe, -n<br/>\n        die <a data-tooltip=\"cafeteria\">Mensa°</a>, die Mensen<br/>\n        die <a data-tooltip=\"lecture\">Vorlesung°</a>, -en<br/>\n        <br/>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"floatleft\" style=\"margin-right:4px;width:150px\">\n      <p>sehr<br/>\n        besonders<br/>\n        intelligent<br/>\n        interessant<br/>\n        groß<br/>\n        jung<br/>\n        sportlich<br/>\n      schön<br/></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"floatleft\" style=\"margin-right:4px;width:150px\">\n      <p>\n        elegant<br/>\n        fair<br/>\n        wichtig<br/>\n        lang<br/>\n        kurz<br/>\n        <a data-tooltip=\"happy\">glücklich°</a><br/>\n      <a data-tooltip=\"famous\">berühmt°</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <form id=\"u2_7\">\n    <p>z.B.: <strong>Jede</strong> Studentin und <strong>jeder</strong> Student hat eine private <span data-tooltip=\"two-room apartment\">Zwei-Zimmer-Wohnung°</span> mit <span data-tooltip=\"kitchen\">Küche°</span> und <span data-tooltip=\"bathroom\">Bad°</span>.</p>\n    <ol class=\"indent-25\">\n      <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"1a\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"2a\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"3a\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"4a\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"5a\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"6a\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"7a\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"8a\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n    </ol>\n    <br/>\n    <p>Now use the plural form of these nouns to make some similar statements:</p>\n    <p> <strong>Alle</strong> Professoren sind …, und <strong>alle</strong> Zimmer haben ...</p>\n    <ol class=\"indent-25\">\n      <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"1b\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"2b\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"3b\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"4b\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"5b\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"6b\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n    </ol>\n    <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"rsTmb\">\n    <h5>Ü2.7</h5>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":null,"label":"Ü2.7","dateCreated":"2020-12-23T15:51:12.053","dateModified":"2020-12-23T15:51:12.24","slideTypeId":2,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":1332,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>Übung 2.8</h3>\n  <p class=\"formBorder\"></p>\n  <p>Imagine that a tour guide is talking to a group of tourists in Munich, pointing out buildings and other sites while making the following comments:</p>\n  <div class=\"clearfix\">\n  <p style=\"clear:both;\"><img class=\"floatleft\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/S2.8_a.png\" style=\"margin:10px 10px 10px 0\"/>»Dieser <a data-tooltip=\"city square, marketplace\">Platz°</a> heißt Marienplatz …« </p>\n  <p style=\"clear:both;\"><img class=\"floatleft\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/S2.8_b.png\" style=\"margin:10px 10px 10px 0\"/>»Jedes Theater in der Stadt ist gut, aber besonders <a data-tooltip=\"well-known\">bekannt°</a> ist <a data-tooltip=\"our\">unser°</a> Nationaltheater«.</p>\n  <p style=\"clear:both;\"><img class=\"floatleft\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/S2.8_c.png\" style=\"margin:10px 10px 10px 0\"/>»<em>Andechser am Dom</em> ist mein <a data-tooltip=\"favorite restaurant\">Lieblingsrestaurant°</a> in der Stadt. Dieses Restaurant serviert …« </p>\n  <p style=\"clear:both;\"><img class=\"floatleft\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/S2.8_d.png\" style=\"margin:10px 10px 10px 0\"/>»Welches Museum ist das schönste? Hmm. Vielleicht dieses …«</p>\n  <p style=\"clear:both;\"><img class=\"floatleft\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/S2.8_e.png\" style=\"margin:10px 10px 10px 0\"/>»Und dieser <a data-tooltip=\"palace\">Palast°</a> ist die Winterresidenz …«</p>\n  <p style=\"clear:both;\"><img class=\"floatleft\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/S2.8_f.png\" style=\"margin:10px 10px 10px 0\"/>»Unsere <a data-tooltip=\"state library\">Staatsbibliothek°</a> hat wichtige Manuskripte aus dem <a data-tooltip=\"Middle Ages\">Mittelalter°</a>«.</p>\n  <p style=\"clear:both;\"><img class=\"floatleft\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/S2.8_g.png\" style=\"margin:10px 10px 10px 0\"/>»Diese <a data-tooltip=\"street\">Straße°</a> ist die Maximilian-Straße…jedes <a data-tooltip=\"store\">Geschäft°</a> ist elegant, jedes Restaurant ist exklusiv …«</p>\n</div>\n<form id=\"u2_8\">\n  <p class=\"formBorder\"></p>\n  <p>Using what you know about <strong>ein-</strong>words and <strong>der-</strong>words, guess the gender of the following words:</p>\n  <p>\n    <span class=\"clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"floatleft\" style=\"width:100px;\"><a data-tooltip=\"marketplace, square\">Platz°:</a></span>\n    <span class=\"floatleft radiobox\">\n      <span><input name=\"1\" type=\"radio\" value=\"der\"/>der</span>\n      <span><input name=\"1\" type=\"radio\" value=\"die\"/>die</span>\n      <span><input name=\"1\" type=\"radio\" value=\"das\"/>das</span>\n    </span>\n  </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <span class=\"clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"floatleft\" style=\"width:100px;\">Museum</span>\n    <span class=\"floatleft radiobox\">\n      <span><input name=\"2\" type=\"radio\" value=\"der\"/>der</span>\n      <span><input name=\"2\" type=\"radio\" value=\"die\"/>die</span>\n      <span><input name=\"2\" type=\"radio\" value=\"das\"/>das</span>\n    </span>\n  </span>\n  </p><p>\n  <span class=\"clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"floatleft\" style=\"width:100px;\"><a data-tooltip=\"library\">Bibliothek°:</a></span>\n    <span class=\"floatleft radiobox\">\n      <span><input name=\"3\" type=\"radio\" value=\"der\"/>der</span>\n      <span><input name=\"3\" type=\"radio\" value=\"die\"/>die</span>\n      <span><input name=\"3\" type=\"radio\" value=\"das\"/>das</span>\n    </span>\n  </span>\n  </p><p>\n  <span class=\"clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"floatleft\" style=\"width:100px;\"><a data-tooltip=\"palace\">Palast°:</a></span>\n    <span class=\"floatleft radiobox\">\n      <span><input name=\"4\" type=\"radio\" value=\"der\"/>der</span>\n      <span><input name=\"4\" type=\"radio\" value=\"die\"/>die</span>\n      <span><input name=\"4\" type=\"radio\" value=\"das\"/>das</span>\n    </span>\n  </span>\n  </p><p>\n  <span class=\"clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"floatleft\" style=\"width:100px;\"><a data-tooltip=\"store\">Geschäft°:</a></span>\n    <span class=\"floatleft radiobox\">\n      <span><input name=\"5\" type=\"radio\" value=\"der\"/>der</span>\n      <span><input name=\"5\" type=\"radio\" value=\"die\"/>die</span>\n      <span><input name=\"5\" type=\"radio\" value=\"das\"/>das</span>\n    </span>\n  </span>\n  </p><p>\n  <span class=\"clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"floatleft\" style=\"width:100px;\">Restaurant</span>\n    <span class=\"floatleft radiobox\">\n      <span><input name=\"6\" type=\"radio\" value=\"der\"/>der</span>\n      <span><input name=\"6\" type=\"radio\" value=\"die\"/>die</span>\n      <span><input name=\"6\" type=\"radio\" value=\"das\"/>das</span>\n    </span>\n  </span>\n</p>  \n<p>\n  <span class=\"clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"floatleft\" style=\"width:100px;\"><a data-tooltip=\"street\">Straße°:</a></span>\n    <span class=\"floatleft radiobox\">\n      <span><input name=\"7\" type=\"radio\" value=\"der\"/>der</span>\n      <span><input name=\"7\" type=\"radio\" value=\"die\"/>die</span>\n      <span><input name=\"7\" type=\"radio\" value=\"das\"/>das</span>\n    </span>\n  </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <span class=\"clearfix\">\n    <span class=\"floatleft\" style=\"width:100px;\">Theater</span>\n    <span class=\"floatleft radiobox\">\n      <span><input name=\"8\" type=\"radio\" value=\"der\"/>der</span>\n      <span><input name=\"8\" type=\"radio\" value=\"die\"/>die</span>\n      <span><input name=\"8\" type=\"radio\" value=\"das\"/>das</span>\n    </span>\n  </span>\n  </p>\n\n\n\n<p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n</form>\n<div class=\"rsTmb\">\n<h5>Ü2.8</h5>\n</div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":null,"label":"Ü2.8","dateCreated":"2024-10-03T20:50:07.807","dateModified":"2024-10-03T20:50:07.833","slideTypeId":2,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":2714,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>Interaktion 2.17</h3>\n  <h4>Vokabel-Recycling</h4>\n  <form id=\"2_17\">\n<p>Was sind die Artikel (<strong>der / die / das</strong>) von diesen <a data-tooltip=\"nouns\">Substantiven°</a>? Schreiben Sie die Artikel in die Lücken, und <a data-tooltip=\"form, construct\">bilden°</a> Sie dann acht Sätze mit diesen Wörtern und den <span data-tooltip=\"other\">anderen°</span> Elementen. </p>\n\n  <div class=\"formBorder\"></div>\n  <div class=\"clearfix\">\n    <div class=\"floatleft width-200\">\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"abend\" type=\"text\"/>Abend</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"buch\" type=\"text\"/>Buch</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"dorf\" type=\"text\"/>Dorf</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"essen\" type=\"text\"/>Essen</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"antwort\" type=\"text\"/>Antwort</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"frage\" type=\"text\"/>Frage</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"floatleft width-200\">\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"Arbeit\" type=\"text\"/>Arbeit</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"land\" type=\"text\"/>Land</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"kurs\" type=\"text\"/>Kurs</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"mann\" type=\"text\"/>Mann</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"Wort\" type=\"text\"/>Wort</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"prufung\" type=\"text\"/>Prüfung</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"floatleft\">\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"stadt\" type=\"text\"/>Stadt</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"studentin\" type=\"text\"/>Studentin</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"stunde\" type=\"text\"/>Stunde</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"tag\" type=\"text\"/>Tag</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"uhr\" type=\"text\"/>Uhr</p>\n      <p><input class=\"width-50\" name=\"woche\" type=\"text\"/>Woche</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <br/>\n  \n<div class=\"formBorder\"></div>\n<p><strong>Andere Elemente:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"clearfix\">\n  <div class=\"floatleft width-20pc\">\n    <p>haben</p>\n    <p>sein </p>\n    <p>gehen</p>\n    <p>heißen</p>\n    <p>lernen</p>\n    <p>verstehen</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"floatleft width-20pc\">\n    <p>machen</p>\n    <p>meinen</p>\n    <p>studieren</p>\n    <p>beginnen</p>\n    <p>schön</p>\n    <p>wichtig</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"floatleft width-20pc\">\n    <p>klein </p>\n    <p>kurz</p>\n    <p>heute</p>\n    <p>am [Montag]</p>\n    <p>Leute</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"floatleft width-20pc\">\n    <p>lang</p>\n    <p>nicht</p>\n    <p>gut</p>\n    <p>jetzt</p>\n    <p>wie</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"floatleft width-20pc\">\n    <p>Stunde, -n</p>\n    <p>lang</p>\n    <p>nicht</p>\n    <p>gut</p>\n    <p>schlecht</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"formBorder\"></div>\n  <p>z.B.: Die Prüfung beginnt in zwei Stunden. / Das Dorf ist sehr klein.</p>\n  <ol class=\"indent-25\">\n    <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"1\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n    <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"2\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n    <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"3\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n    <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"4\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n    <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"5\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n    <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"6\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n    <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"7\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n    <li><p><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"8\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n  </ol>\n  <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n</form>\n<div class=\"rsTmb\">\n  <h5>2.17</h5>\n</div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":"2022","label":"2.17","dateCreated":"2023-01-12T15:24:44.17","dateModified":"2023-01-12T15:24:44.21","slideTypeId":3,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":665,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>Interaktion 2.18</h3>\n  <h4>Die digitale Familie</h4>\n  <form id=\"2_18\">\n      <br/>\n  <p><img src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/I2.18.jpg\" class=\"width-500\"/></p>\n  <p class=\"phrasebox vocab\">\n      <span><a data-tooltip=\"was\">war°</a></span>\n      <span><a data-tooltip=\"here: 'sheesh!' (exasperated)\">boah°</a></span>\n      <span><a data-tooltip=\"why\">wofür°</a></span>\n  </p>\n  \n      <div class=\"formBorder\"></div>\n    <p>Wie vernetzt ist Ihre Familie? Schreiben Sie ein bisschen über Medien und Kommunikation in Ihrer Familie!</p>\n\n    <p>Vokabeln <a data-tooltip=\"for this\">dafür°</a>:</p>\n    <p class=\"phrasebox\">\n      <span>twittern</span>\n      <span>zoomen</span>\n      <span><a data-tooltip=\"text messages\">SMS°</a> schicken</span>\n      <span>telefonieren</span>\n      <span>Instagram benutzen</span>\n    </p>\n    <p>Strukturen dafür:</p>\n    <p class=\"phrasebox\">\n      <span>Ich <span class=\"width-50 blank-line\"></span> mit meiner Familie.</span>\n      <span>Ich <span class=\"width-50 blank-line\"></span> mit meinem Bruder/mit meiner Schwester.</span>\n      <span>Ich <span class=\"width-50 blank-line\"></span> <strong>nicht</strong> mit meiner Familie.</span>\n      <span>Meine Eltern <span class=\"width-50 blank-line\"></span> mit mir.</span>\n      <span>Meine Eltern <span class=\"width-50 blank-line\"></span> <strong>nicht</strong> mit mir</span>\n      <span>... schreibt/schreiben mir E-Mails</span>\n      <span>... schickt/schicken mir Fotos/SMS</span>\n      <span>jeden Tag</span>\n      <span>jede Woche</span>\n      <span>jeden <a data-tooltip=\"month\">Monat°</a></span>\n    </p>\n    <p>Schreiben Sie hier:</p>\n    <p><textarea class=\"textarea-default\" name=\"1\"></textarea></p>\n    <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"rsTmb\">\n    <h5>2.18</h5>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":null,"label":"2.18","dateCreated":"2022-07-07T14:50:14.647","dateModified":"2022-07-07T14:50:14.69","slideTypeId":3,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":2716,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>Interaktion 2.19</h3>\n  <h4>Meine Familie</h4>\n  <form id=\"2_19\">\n    \n<img class=\"width-400\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/I2.19.B.jpg\"/>\n  \n<p>Max kommt aus Konstanz &#8212; das ist im Süden von Deutschland, wo seine Eltern noch wohnen. Er <a data-tooltip=\"erzählen: to talk, tell a story\">erzählt°</a> hier über seine Familie &#8212; über die Eltern, Geschwister, Großeltern, wo sie alle wohnen, was sie machen, wie alt sie sind, <a data-tooltip=\"etc.\">usw</a>.</p>\n<br/>\n\n\n<p><span><a class=\"audio-player\" data-audio=\"/audio/kapitel2/I.2.19.Julius.mp3\"></a></span></p>\n<br/>\n\n<p>Zwei Aufgaben für Sie:</p>\n  \n<ol>\n  <div class=\"indent-20\">\n   <li><p>Hören Sie gut zu &#8212; so oft wie Sie <a data-tooltip=\"so ... wollen: as often as you want\">wollen°</a> &#8212; und schreiben Sie <a data-tooltip=\"at least\">mindestens°</a> <u>fünf</u> Details aus der Story, z.B. »Seine Schwester heißt …«  »Er wohnt in …« usw.</p>\n   <br/>\n   <textarea class=\"textarea-default\" name=\"response\"></textarea>\n   </li>\n   \n   <li><p>Welche Vokabeln benutzt er? Markieren alle Vokabeln auf der Liste, <a data-tooltip=\"that\">die°</a> Sie hören:</p>\n   \n     <p><input name=\"eigentlich\" type=\"checkbox\"/>eigentlich</p>\n     <p><input name=\"alle\" type=\"checkbox\"/>alle</p>\n     <p><input name=\"natürlich\" type=\"checkbox\"/>natürlich</p>\n     <p><input name=\"vielleicht\" type=\"checkbox\"/>vielleicht</p>\n     <p><input name=\"besonders\" type=\"checkbox\"/>besonders</p>\n     <p><input name=\"ein bisschen\" type=\"checkbox\"/>ein bisschen</p>\n     <p><input name=\"wichtig\" type=\"checkbox\"/>wichtig</p>\n     <p><input name=\"Bruder\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Bruder</p>\n     <p><input name=\"Beziehung\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Beziehung</p>\n     <p><input name=\"wirklich\" type=\"checkbox\"/>wirklich</p>\n    \n  \n\n   \n   </li>  \n  \n  \n  \n  <div>\n</ol>       \n\n    \n    <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"rsTmb\">\n    <h5>2.19</h5>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":"2022","label":"2.19","dateCreated":"2024-10-08T14:31:16.507","dateModified":"2024-10-08T14:31:16.56","slideTypeId":3,"parentSlideId":null},{"id":667,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>Interaktion 2.20</h3>\n  <h4>Statistiken zum Thema »Familie« in Deutschland</h4>\n  <br/>\n  <img class=\"width-100pc\" src=\"/images/kapitel2/t2/I2.20.png\"/>\n  <p>Die Familien in Deutschland ...</p>\n  <form id=\"2_20\">\n    <p><input name=\"1\" type=\"radio\" value=\"werden kleiner\"/><a data-tooltip=\"are becoming\">werden°</a> kleiner</p>\n    <p><input name=\"1\" type=\"radio\" value=\"werden größer\"/>werden größer</p>\n    <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"rsTmb\">\n    <h5>2.20</h5>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":null,"label":"2.20","dateCreated":"2018-08-14T22:05:02.137","dateModified":"2018-09-26T12:50:25.203","slideTypeId":3,"parentSlideId":0},{"id":668,"content":"<div class=\"rsContent\">\n  <h3>Interaktion 2.21</h3>\n  <h4>Diktat</h4>\n  <form id=\"2_21\">\n    <p><span data-tooltip=\"listen carefully\">Hören Sie gut zu°</span>, und schreiben Sie <a data-tooltip=\"exactly\">genau°</a>, was Sie hören!</p>\n    <ol class=\"indent-25 lineheight-large\">\n      <li><p><a class=\"audio\" data-audio=\"/audio/kapitel2/I.2.21_A.mp3\"></a><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"2.21a\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <!-- <p>[[audio: Meine Eltern wohnen weit von hier, aber sie schreiben jede Woche.]]</p> -->\n      <li><p><a class=\"audio\" data-audio=\"/audio/kapitel2/I.2.21_B.mp3\"></a><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"2.21b\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <!-- [[audio: Natürlich benutze ich das Internet, aber nicht immer, wie du.]] -->\n      <li><p><a class=\"audio\" data-audio=\"/audio/kapitel2/I.2.21_C.mp3\"></a><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"2.21c\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <!-- [audio: Mein Vater ist 52 Jahre alt, und meine Mutter ist 50.]] -->\n      <li><p><a class=\"audio\" data-audio=\"/audio/kapitel2/I.2.21_D.mp3\"></a><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"2.21d\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <!-- [[audio: Kennst du meine Freundin? Sie heißt Stephanie und studiert in Berlin.]] -->\n      <li><p><a class=\"audio\" data-audio=\"/audio/kapitel2/I.2.21_E.mp3\"></a><input class=\"width-600\" name=\"2.21e\" type=\"text\"/></p></li>\n      <!-- [[audio: Dieser Kurs ist wirklich gut, und die Professorin ist sehr interessant.]] -->\n    </ol>\n    <p><input class=\"submit\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Speichern\"/></p>\n  </form>\n  <div class=\"rsTmb\">\n    <h5>2.21</h5>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","kapitel":2,"thema":2,"version":null,"label":"2.21","dateCreated":"2023-01-12T14:59:20.073","dateModified":"2023-01-12T14:59:20.11","slideTypeId":3,"parentSlideId":null}]